  "verification_limits": [
    "The production GameScene starts at level 71 and runs through level 80 using the standard Continue buttons.",
    "Ordinary boards use recorded gestures and controlled special placements. The level 71 first color match uses the authored tiles.",
    "Level 80 uses twenty legal gestures. The shuffle locks input while preserving the coin cells, collected goal count, and move budget.",
    "Offline geometry checks compare against the recovered decoder. The runtime uses Unity Animator and Mesh. Original tutorials, physical mobile touch, rendered-original parity and level 81 onward remain open."
  ],
